## Final Comparison

| Approach       | Time        | Extra Space |
| -------------- | ----------- | ----------- |
| Brute Force    | \\(O(nk)\\) | \\(O(1)\\)  |
| Prefix Sum     | \\(O(n)\\)  | \\(O(n)\\)  |
| Sliding Window | \\(O(n)\\)  | \\(O(1)\\)  |

Yaad rakhne ki line: Fixed-size window mein `new sum = old sum - outgoing element + incoming element`.

Pattern: Jab question mein maximum/minimum sum or average of a subarray of size exactly `k` aaye, toh Fixed-Size Sliding Window try karo.
